data: {"id": "861623e086dc4f84-thinking-parallel_evidence-314", "run_id": "861623e086dc4f84", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "kubectl_run_image", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "在命名空间 'aiops-case-07' 中尝试创建 Pod 资源被拒绝，原因是 serviceaccount 'system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager' 缺乏权限，且 Python 解释器文件未找到。\nkey_facts: [\"操作: kubectl_run_image\", \"命名空间 (namespace): aiops-case-07\", ", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789072386562, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_4cbf1e3d293a40e0b7b58d3b", "tool_sequence": 17, "semantic_success": true, "result": "在命名空间 'aiops-case-07' 中尝试创建 Pod 资源被拒绝，原因是 serviceaccount 'system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager' 缺乏权限，且 Python 解释器文件未找到。\nkey_facts: [\"操作: kubectl_run_image\", \"命名空间 (namespace): aiops-case-07\", \"目标资源: pods\", \"错误类型: Forbidden (403)\", \"具体原因: User \\\"system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager\\\" cannot create resource \\\"pods\\\" in API group \\\"\\\"\", \"附加信息: FILE_NOT_FOUND for /usr/local/bin/python3\"]\nconflicts: [\"current_summary 标记为 success: true，但 raw_preview 显示服务器返回 Forbidden 错误，且 stdout 包含具体错误消息。以 raw_preview 为准，实际为执行失败。\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/861623e086dc4f84-g1/tools/018-evidence-kubectl_run_image.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/861623e086dc4f84-g1/tools/018-evidence-kubectl_run_image.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/861623e086dc4f84-g1/tools/018-evidence-kubectl_run_image.summary.txt"}

