oopBackOff`。\n\n证据支撑：\n- 容器退出码为 `78` (证据 1, 6)；\n- 日志中存在明确的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 报错模式 (证据 3)；\n- 分布式追踪 Span 中 `aiops.observed_mode` 明确标记为 `config_missing_exit` (证据 5)；\n- 所有外部对 `/work` 的请求均收到 500 响应 (证据 4)。\n\n**缺失决定因素：**\n输入数据明确标识缺少 `ConfigMap 'workload-code'` 中具体缺失的配置键名，以及代码中触发 `sys.exit(78)` 的具体逻辑路径。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 109.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 109.5s (Evidence 100.1s, RCA 9.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 139.734, "metrics": {"run_id": "861623e086dc4f84", "mttr": {"value": "2.3m", "seconds": 139.73908805847168, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "d